* The initial commander has had, for a while now, an heretofore-undocumented feature whereby the presence of a non-empty value for the environment variable COMMANDER_INITIAL_PERSIST will prevent the world from exiting when end-of-file is encountered on the standard input.  The change is to not print the "Exiting ..." message in this case.  The farewell message was also changed to be "Exiting Initial Commander".
